        <body>
            <div xml:id="d777">

                <pb facs="0742" n="626" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg626"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/63.]</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-02-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 27, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>This Government needs to know at once whether the Secretary will come to
                    Tegucigalpa or only to Amapala, in order to make the plans for his
                    reception.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
